Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 02:50:58 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] feat(compression): summarise listed or larger-window chats on
 their own main model

auxiliary.compression.main_model_providers lists main providers whose chats
send their compression summary to their own main model and keep the main
window's trigger. main_model_when_larger does the same for any chat whose
window is larger than the compression model's. Both default off.
